{% comment %}
  Main navigation — desktop mega menu (PC) + off-canvas drawer (mobile).

  Decisions in force (task-header.md, 2026-10-09 / 2026-10-12):
  - O-5: two separate DOM trees, never shared. Desktop is hover/focus-within driven;
    mobile is a native <dialog> opened with showModal() so focus trapping, background
    inert, Esc-to-close and ::backdrop come from the platform instead of hand-rolled JS.
  - O-1: sticky is PC only, and only inside the min-width media query.
  - BUG-023: a menu item that has children is a GROUP. Its url may be empty, so it must
    never be rendered as an <a> — that would emit a dead href="#" link.
  - ARIA: current page is taken from link.current / link.child_current rather than by
    comparing URL strings ourselves.
  - 2026-10-12 mega rework: top-level groups render a full-width mega panel
    (columns per second-level item, third level listed inside the column) instead of a
    narrow dropdown with a flyout. The panel spans the whole viewport width (anchored
    against the desktop row), while its inner content stays aligned to the content
    column. It slides in and out (display transition with allow-discrete, graceful
    degradation to instant hide on older browsers). Right column: auto-derived
    collection grid. Every second-level menu item that points to a collection
    renders as a card (cover image + title), no section block or merchant config
    required. The column is omitted when the top-level item has no collection links.
  - 2026-10-12 second round (刘工): no dropdown chevrons on desktop. A dark sliding
    pill (assets/nav-pill.js, custom element nav-pill) follows hover/keyboard focus
    across the top-level items and hides when the pointer leaves the nav. aria-current
    stays as static brand-color text — a "you are here" cue must not vanish with the
    hover state (SDD §8.2). No-JS fallback: hovered item tints itself dark, no sliding.
  - 2026-10-13 mobile drawer rework (刘工, 参考效果图): the mobile drawer is a
    bottom sheet — dialog slides UP from the bottom edge (translate 0 100% → 0).
    Submenus are drill-down panels instead of an in-place accordion: tapping a
    group row slides a full panel in from the right (iOS-style stack: the panel
    being left slides out to -100%). Each sub panel carries its own head row
    (back arrow / title / close). Panels are all rendered server-side (flat list,
    three capped loops) and toggled by nav-drawer.js via an explicit stack —
    no DOM building at navigation time.

  Recursion is deliberately capped at three levels (Shop > Mowers > Walk-behind).
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign menu = section.settings.menu
  assign brand_name = section.settings.brand_name | default: shop.name
  assign logo_image = section.settings.logo
-%}

{% comment -%}
  This section is the whole sticky header row (decision 2026-10-09, option A).

  account and cart used to be separate sections, which broke sticky: they are
  sibling nodes of this one, so the menu would pin to the viewport top while the
  cart and account icons scrolled away — leaving an unusable strip. Everything that
  belongs on the pinned row therefore lives INSIDE this section.

  Layout is three zones (logo / menu / tools). Search is an icon-only toggle in
  the tools cluster; clicking it opens a right-side drawer (the <search-drawer>
  element at the bottom of this file) that carries the full predictive search
  form — 2026-10-10 刘工 requirement: the row itself never grows a search input.

  Mobile is unaffected: it uses the drawer at the bottom of this file, which already
  renders its own account and cart copies.
{% endcomment -%}

<nav class="main-nav full-width" aria-label="{{ 'navigation.menu' | t }}">
  {%- comment -%}
    BUG-044 防御修法：编辑器对大体积纯 ASCII 的 section 输出会静默丢弃整组。
    判据落在 <nav> 首子节点的文本字节层（含 ≥1 个非 ASCII 字节才走正常路径，
    深处或 HTML 实体均无效——2026-10-19 刘工实测）。此 span 是唯一的非 ASCII
    落点：字面量「→」(U+2192)，视觉与无障碍树均隐藏，不产生任何可见痕迹。
    平台 bug 修复后此元素应删除（见 dev-docs/bugs.md BUG-044）。
  {%- endcomment -%}
  <span class="main-nav__bug044-guard" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
  <div class="main-nav__desktop" data-nav-pill-anchor>
    <div class="main-nav__inner">
      {%- comment -%}
        Zone 0: logo + brand name. Links home. The image is decorative
        (alt="") because the visible brand text already names the link.

        2026-10-21 两处修正：
        1. 没有 logo 时**不渲染 img**，只留品牌名。旧注释说"回落到内置的
           logo_webp.webp"，但那段代码从来没写过——`logo_src` 只在 if 里 assign，
           商家清空 logo 后会输出 `<img src="">`（一个 40×40 的破图框）。
           不回落内置资源是刻意的：assets/logo_webp.webp 是 156 KB 原图，
           `image_url` 对 assets 无效、无法缩放，为一个 40px 图标拉 156 KB 不值。
        2. width/height 用图片**真实固有尺寸**，不再写死 40×40。尺寸由 CSS 收
           （block-size 固定、inline-size 按比例），所以任何比例的 logo 都不会被压扁；
           写死 40×40 会让非方形 logo 变形，并被 Lighthouse image-aspect-ratio 判失败。
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <a class="main-nav__logo" href="{{ routes.root_url }}">
        {%- if logo_image != blank -%}
          <img
            class="main-nav__logo-img"
            src="{{ logo_image | image_url: width: 160 }}"
            srcset="
              {{- logo_image | image_url: width: 80 }} 80w,
              {{- logo_image | image_url: width: 120 }} 120w,
              {{- logo_image | image_url: width: 160 }} 160w,
              {{- logo_image | image_url: width: 240 }} 240w
            "
            sizes="40px"
            alt=""
            width="{{ logo_image.width }}"
            height="{{ logo_image.height }}"
            loading="eager"
          >
        {%- endif -%}
        <span class="main-nav__brand">{{ brand_name }}</span>
      </a>

      {%- if menu.links.size > 0 -%}
        <nav-pill class="main-nav__list-wrap">
          <ul class="main-nav__list" role="list">
            {%- for link in menu.links -%}
              {%- liquid
                assign has_children = false
                if link.links.size > 0
                  assign has_children = true
                endif
                assign is_current = false
                if link.current
                  assign is_current = true
                endif
                assign in_branch = false
                if link.child_current or link.child_active
                  assign in_branch = true
                endif

                comment
                  面板形态判定（2026-10-28）：子项撑得起 mega 三栏面板才走 mega——
                  即存在「指向有商品集合的二级项」或「带三级子项的二级项」。
                  子项全是页面/博客链接时（如 Support）走普通下拉，
                  避免 mega 中区一片空白、左列孤零零挂在通栏白底左边。
                endcomment
                assign has_mega_content = false
                if has_children
                  for sub in link.links
                    if sub.links.size > 0
                      assign has_mega_content = true
                      break
                    endif
                    if sub.type == 'collection_link' and sub.object != blank and sub.object.all_products_count > 0
                      assign has_mega_content = true
                      break
                    endif
                  endfor
                endif
              -%}

              <li
                class="main-nav__item{% if in_branch %} main-nav__item--in-branch{% endif %}{% if has_children %}{% if has_mega_content %} main-nav__item--group{% else %} main-nav__item--dropdown{% endif %}{% endif %}"
              >
                {%- if has_children -%}
                  {%- comment -%}
                    分组项：只出 <span>，不输出 <a>（BUG-023）。
                    "li 自身不能创建定位上下文"仅针对 mega 项——mega 面板锚定在
                    .main-nav__desktop 上（整行宽、内容列对齐）；普通下拉反过来
                    锚在 li 上，所以只有 --dropdown 那一支给 li 加 position: relative。
                    不带下拉箭头（2026-10-12 刘工）：选中态交给滑动药丸指示器。
                  {%- endcomment -%}
                  {%- comment -%}
                    键盘可达性（2026-10-28）：span 必须可聚焦，否则 :focus-within
                    永不成立、Tab 键根本打不开面板（WCAG 2.1 AA 键盘可操作）。
                    面板展开由 CSS :hover / :focus-within 驱动，不需要 JS 响应
                    Enter/Space，故不设 role="button"（那是"按下即动作"的语义，
                    与这里"聚焦即展开"不符）。focus-visible 轮廓已有全局规则。
                  {%- endcomment -%}
                  <span class="main-nav__link main-nav__link--group" aria-haspopup="true" tabindex="0">
                    {{ link.title }}
                  </span>

                  {%- if has_mega_content -%}
                  {%- comment -%}
                    Mega 面板（2026-10-13 第八轮，参考 demo 截图三段式）：
                    左列 = 二级分类导航（直接取菜单二级项，无 block 配置）；
                    中区 = 二级集合项的产品卡组（集合直接取自该菜单项指向的集合，
                    零配置；图/价/产品数均走真实对象，不伪造）。
                    叶子二级项只在左列出链接，中区不输出空壳组。
                  {%- endcomment -%}
                  <div class="main-nav__mega">
                    <div class="main-nav__mega-inner">
                      <div class="main-nav__mega-nav">
                        <span class="main-nav__mega-label">{{ link.title }}</span>
                        <ul class="main-nav__mega-cats" role="list">
                          {%- for child in link.links -%}
                            <li class="main-nav__mega-cat">
                              {%- if child.links.size > 0 -%}
                                <span
                                  class="main-nav__mega-cat-link main-nav__mega-cat-link--group{% if child.child_current or child.child_active %} main-nav__mega-cat-link--current{% endif %}"
                                  tabindex="0"
                                  data-mega-tab="{{ forloop.index }}"
                                >
                                  {{ child.title }}
                                </span>
                              {%- else -%}
                                <a
                                  class="main-nav__mega-cat-link{% if child.current %} main-nav__mega-cat-link--current{% endif %}"
                                  href="{{ child.url }}"
                                  tabindex="0"
                                  data-mega-tab="{{ forloop.index }}"
                                  {% if child.current %}
                                    aria-current="page"
                                  {% endif %}
                                >
                                  {{ child.title }}
                                </a>
                              {%- endif -%}
                            </li>
                          {%- endfor -%}
                        </ul>
                        {%- comment -%}
                          View all products（2026-10-13 刘工）：官方内置的
                          /collections/all 路由，箭头符合准则（View All 链接）。
                        {%- endcomment -%}
                        <a
                          class="main-nav__mega-viewall"
                          href="{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}"
                        >
                          {{ 'navigation.view_all_products' | t }}
                          <span class="main-nav__mega-viewall-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                        </a>
                      </div>

                      <div class="main-nav__mega-content">
                        {%- for child in link.links -%}
                          {%- liquid
                            assign child_title = child.title | strip
                            assign mega_collection = blank
                            if child.type == 'collection_link' and child.object != blank
                              assign mega_collection = child.object
                            endif
                          -%}
                          {%- comment -%}
                            存在性用 all_products_count 判（计数随 collection 对象返回，不加载商品）；
                            勿用 collection.products.size——那会为每个集合型二级项拉满整页商品，
                            导航是全局组件，这条开销每次开面板都要付。
                          {%- endcomment -%}
                          {%- if mega_collection != blank and mega_collection.all_products_count > 0 -%}
                            {%- comment -%}
                              产品卡阵列（2026-10-28 改）：集合直接取该二级菜单项
                              指向的集合（link.object），零配置、无 block 映射。
                              组头带 "集合名 (n) →" 出口（View All 型链接，箭头合规）；
                              集合名与菜单项同名时不重复输出，只留计数。
                              三级链接收进组底小链接行，导航功能不丢。
                            {%- endcomment -%}
                            <div class="main-nav__mega-group" data-mega-panel="{{ forloop.index }}">
                              {%- comment -%}
                                组头一段式（2026-10-28 刘工）：左侧单个入口
                                "All {集合名} (n) →"，不再有右侧 All 链接。
                                一段式的好处：不留空壳、不重复、可访问名完整
                                （不能只留 "(n) →"——那样链接名只剩数字）。
                                文案走 navigation.all_collection_products，
                                变量用 total 而非 count：count 在 Shopify 翻译里
                                会触发复数形式查找。
                              {%- endcomment -%}
                              <div class="main-nav__mega-group-head">
                                <a
                                  class="main-nav__mega-group-title-link"
                                  href="{{ mega_collection.url }}"
                                >
                                  {{
                                    'navigation.all_collection_products'
                                    | t: title: mega_collection.title, total: mega_collection.all_products_count
                                  }}
                                  <span class="main-nav__mega-group-all-arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
                                </a>
                              </div>
                              <ul class="main-nav__mega-cards" role="list">
                                {%- for product in mega_collection.products limit: 3 -%}
                                  <li class="main-nav__mega-card">
                                    <a
                                      class="main-nav__mega-card-link"
                                      href="{{ product.url }}"
                                    >
                                      {%- assign card_image = product.featured_image -%}
                                      {%- if card_image != blank -%}
                                        <span class="main-nav__mega-card-media">
                                          {{
                                            card_image
                                            | image_url: width: 640
                                            | image_tag:
                                              widths: '240, 360, 480, 640',
                                              sizes: '20rem',
                                              loading: 'lazy',
                                              alt: '',
                                              class: 'main-nav__mega-card-img'
                                          }}
                                        </span>
                                      {%- else -%}
                                        <span
                                          class="main-nav__mega-card-media main-nav__mega-card-media--empty"
                                          aria-hidden="true"
                                        ></span>
                                      {%- endif -%}
                                      {%- if product.vendor != blank -%}
                                        <span class="main-nav__mega-card-vendor">{{ product.vendor }}</span>
                                      {%- endif -%}
                                      <span class="main-nav__mega-card-title">{{ product.title }}</span>
                                      <span class="main-nav__mega-card-price">
                                        {{ product.price | money }}
                                      </span>
                                    </a>
                                  </li>
                                {%- endfor -%}
                              </ul>
                              {%- if child.links.size > 0 -%}
                                <ul class="main-nav__mega-sublinks" role="list">
                                  {%- for grandchild in child.links -%}
                                    <li>
                                      <a
                                        class="main-nav__mega-sublink{% if grandchild.current %} main-nav__mega-sublink--current{% endif %}"
                                        href="{{ grandchild.url }}"
                                        {% if grandchild.current %}
                                          aria-current="page"
                                        {% endif %}
                                      >
                                        {{ grandchild.title }}
                                      </a>
                                    </li>
                                  {%- endfor -%}
                                </ul>
                              {%- endif -%}
                            </div>
                          {%- elsif child.links.size > 0 -%}
                            {%- comment -%}
                              回退：二级项自身不是集合链接（指向页面/商品/无链接）
                              但有三级子项时 → 把三级项渲染成集合卡组，
                              保证任何菜单结构都有体面呈现，不留空壳。
                            {%- endcomment -%}
                            <div class="main-nav__mega-group" data-mega-panel="{{ forloop.index }}">
                              <span class="main-nav__mega-group-title">{{ child.title }}</span>
                              <ul class="main-nav__mega-cards" role="list">
                                {%- for grandchild in child.links -%}
                                  <li class="main-nav__mega-card">
                                    <a
                                      class="main-nav__mega-card-link{% if grandchild.current %} main-nav__mega-card-link--current{% endif %}"
                                      href="{{ grandchild.url }}"
                                      {% if grandchild.current %}
                                        aria-current="page"
                                      {% endif %}
                                    >
                                      {%- if grandchild.type == 'collection_link' and grandchild.object != blank -%}
                                        {%- liquid
                                          assign coll = grandchild.object
                                          assign card_image = coll.featured_image
                                          if card_image == blank
                                            assign card_image = coll.products.first.image
                                          endif
                                        -%}
                                        {%- if card_image != blank -%}
                                          <span class="main-nav__mega-card-media">
                                            {{
                                              card_image
                                              | image_url: width: 640
                                              | image_tag:
                                                widths: '240, 360, 480, 640',
                                                sizes: '20rem',
                                                loading: 'lazy',
                                                alt: '',
                                                class: 'main-nav__mega-card-img'
                                            }}
                                          </span>
                                        {%- else -%}
                                          {%- comment -%} 集合无图：色块占位，不渲染空 img {%- endcomment -%}
                                          <span
                                            class="main-nav__mega-card-media main-nav__mega-card-media--empty"
                                            aria-hidden="true"
                                          ></span>
                                        {%- endif -%}
                                        <span class="main-nav__mega-card-title">{{ grandchild.title }}</span>
                                        {%- if coll.all_products_count > 0 -%}
                                          <span class="main-nav__mega-card-count">
                                            {{ 'navigation.products_count' | t: count: coll.all_products_count }}
                                          </span>
                                        {%- endif -%}
                                      {%- else -%}
                                        {%- comment -%} 非集合链接的三级项：纯文字卡，体面降级 {%- endcomment -%}
                                        <span
                                          class="main-nav__mega-card-media main-nav__mega-card-media--empty"
                                          aria-hidden="true"
                                        ></span>
                                        <span class="main-nav__mega-card-title">{{ grandchild.title }}</span>
                                      {%- endif -%}
                                    </a>
                                  </li>
                                {%- endfor -%}
                              </ul>
                            </div>
                          {%- endif -%}
                        {%- endfor -%}
                      </div>

                    </div>
                  </div>
                  {%- else -%}
                    {%- comment -%}
                      普通下拉（2026-10-28）：子项全是页面/博客等非集合链接时，
                      不出 mega 三栏（中区会一片空白），改成贴在项下方的小面板。
                      纯 CSS :hover / :focus-within 驱动——面板是 li 的后代，
                      鼠标移进面板时 li 的 hover 链不断，不需要 JS 拖尾。
                      不带 --group 类，故不进 JS 的 _groups，不触左列药丸与 tab 切换。
                    {%- endcomment -%}
                    <div class="main-nav__dropdown">
                      <ul class="main-nav__dropdown-list" role="list">
                        {%- for child in link.links -%}
                          <li>
                            <a
                              class="main-nav__dropdown-link{% if child.current %} main-nav__dropdown-link--current{% endif %}"
                              href="{{ child.url }}"
                              {% if child.current %}
                                aria-current="page"
                              {% endif %}
                            >
                              {{ child.title }}
                            </a>
                          </li>
                        {%- endfor -%}
                      </ul>
                    </div>
                  {%- endif -%}
                {%- else -%}
                  {%- comment -%} 叶子项：才输出 <a> {%- endcomment -%}
                  <a
                    class="main-nav__link{% if is_current %} main-nav__link--current{% endif %}"
                    href="{{ link.url }}"
                    {% if is_current %}
                      aria-current="page"
                    {% endif %}
                  >
                    {{ link.title }}
                  </a>
                {%- endif -%}
              </li>
            {%- endfor -%}
          </ul>
        </nav-pill>
      {%- endif -%}

      {%- comment -%}
        Zone 2: tools. Rendered here (not as sibling sections) so they stay on the
        pinned row — see the file header note.

        The search toggle is icon-only (2026-10-10 刘工): the input never lives on
        the row. It opens the <search-drawer> at the bottom of this file.
        results_limit rides along into the drawer via the snippet param.
      {%- endcomment -%}
      <div class="main-nav__tools">
        <button
          type="button"
          class="main-nav__search-toggle"
          aria-label="{{ 'search.label' | t }}"
          aria-haspopup="dialog"
          data-search-drawer-open
        >
          {{ 'icon-search.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
        </button>

        {% render 'account-entry', menu: section.settings.customer_account_menu %}
        {%- comment -%} 对比入口紧邻购物车左侧（SDD §6.2.8）；单文件内部做页面探测，未配置则整块不输出 {%- endcomment -%}
        {% render 'compare-entry' %}
        {% render 'cart-entry' %}

        {%- comment -%}
          #21 Follow on Shop. Default off: action 'follow' needs extra store config,
          and an unconfigured button is a dead control. Colours are the component's
          own — do not restyle (AGENTS.md §5).
        {%- endcomment -%}
        {%- if section.settings.show_follow_on_shop and shop.customer_accounts_enabled -%}
          <div class="account__follow">
            {{ shop | login_button }}
          </div>
        {%- endif -%}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  {%- comment -%}
    ═══════ 下面是 y7 实验时整段删掉的代码，用 HTML 注释包着保留 ═══════
    放开某一段 = 删掉那一段的 HTML 注释开行（单独一行 <!--）与闭行（单独一行 -->），
    三段彼此不嵌套、各段内标签自平衡，可以单独放开单独验证。
    注意：HTML 注释里的 Liquid 仍会被服务端执行（只是输出不可见），无副作用；
    调试结束后这三段应当删除，不要留在正式主题里。
  {%- endcomment -%}
  {%- comment -%} 【A】移动块外壳 + 两枚按钮（原文件 458–478，末行是 697 的收尾 div） {%- endcomment -%}
  <div class="main-nav__mobile">
    <button
      type="button"
      class="main-nav__burger"
      aria-label="{{ 'navigation.menu' | t }}"
      aria-haspopup="dialog"
      data-nav-drawer-open
    >
      {{ 'icon-menu.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
    </button>

    {%- comment -%} 移动端：汉堡居左、搜索图标推到最右 {%- endcomment -%}
    <button
      type="button"
      class="main-nav__search-toggle main-nav__search-toggle--mobile"
      aria-label="{{ 'search.label' | t }}"
      aria-haspopup="dialog"
      data-search-drawer-open
    >
      {{ 'icon-search.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
    </button>
  </div>
  {%- comment -%} 【B】移动抽屉 nav-drawer（原文件 480–696） {%- endcomment -%}

  <nav-drawer>
    <dialog class="nav-drawer" data-nav-drawer aria-labelledby="nav-drawer-title">
      {%- comment -%} 内容存 <template>，首次打开才实例化（AGENTS §6） {%- endcomment -%}
      <template data-nav-drawer-template>
        {%- comment -%}
          2026-10-13 钻入式抽屉（刘工，参考效果图）：
          面板平铺渲染（根面板 + 每个分组一个子面板，三层封顶），由 nav-drawer.js
          用显式栈在面板间切换——右滑进子面板 / 左滑退回。分组行是 <button>
          （BUG-023：有子项即 GROUP，无 url，绝不渲染成 <a>）。
        {%- endcomment -%}
        <div class="nav-drawer__panels">
          {%- comment -%} ---- 面板 0：根菜单 ---- {%- endcomment -%}
          <div class="nav-drawer__panel is-active" data-nav-panel>
            <div class="nav-drawer__head nav-drawer__head--root">
              {%- comment -%}
                品牌区复刻参考图：logo + 品牌名，链回首页。图片 alt=""
                ——可见的品牌文字已命名该链接（与桌面 Zone 0 同一约定）。
              {%- endcomment -%}
              <a class="nav-drawer__brand" href="{{ routes.root_url }}">
                {%- comment -%}
                  与桌面 Zone 0 同一约定：装饰图 alt=""，无 logo 时不渲染 img，
                  width/height 用真实固有尺寸由 CSS 收（见 Zone 0 注释）。
                {%- endcomment -%}
                {%- if logo_image != blank -%}
                  <img
                    class="nav-drawer__brand-img"
                    src="{{ logo_image | image_url: width: 96 }}"
                    srcset="
                      {{- logo_image | image_url: width: 64 }} 64w,
                      {{- logo_image | image_url: width: 96 }} 96w,
                      {{- logo_image | image_url: width: 144 }} 144w
                    "
                    sizes="32px"
                    alt=""
                    width="{{ logo_image.width }}"
                    height="{{ logo_image.height }}"
                    loading="lazy"
                  >
                {%- endif -%}
                <span class="nav-drawer__brand-name">{{ brand_name }}</span>
              </a>
              <h2 class="nav-drawer__title visually-hidden" id="nav-drawer-title">
                {{ 'navigation.menu' | t }}
              </h2>
              {%- comment -%}
                搜索图标（2026-10-13 刘工）：放头部、关闭按钮左侧。
                点击叠加打开搜索抽屉，不关本抽屉（nav-drawer.js 的 _onSearch）。
              {%- endcomment -%}
              <button
                type="button"
                class="nav-drawer__search"
                aria-label="{{ 'search.label' | t }}"
                data-nav-search
              >
                {{ 'icon-search.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
              </button>
              <button
                type="button"
                class="nav-drawer__close"
                aria-label="{{ 'navigation.close' | t }}"
                data-nav-drawer-close
              >
                {{ 'icon-close.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
              </button>
            </div>

            <ul class="nav-drawer__list" role="list">
              {%- for link in menu.links -%}
                <li class="nav-drawer__item">
                  {%- if link.links.size > 0 -%}
                    <button
                      type="button"
                      class="nav-drawer__link nav-drawer__link--group"
                      data-nav-open="{{ section.id }}-nav-panel-{{ forloop.index }}"
                    >
                      <span>{{ link.title }}</span>
                      {{ 'icon-chevron-right.svg' | inline_asset_content }}
                    </button>
                  {%- else -%}
                    <a
                      class="nav-drawer__link{% if link.current %} nav-drawer__link--current{% endif %}"
                      href="{{ link.url }}"
                      {% if link.current %}
                        aria-current="page"
                      {% endif %}
                    >
                      <span>{{ link.title }}</span>
                    </a>
                  {%- endif -%}
                </li>
              {%- endfor -%}
            </ul>

            {%- comment -%}
              #22 要求 <shopify-account> 移动端也可见。抽屉内容虽存于 <template>
              （首次打开才实例化），组件本身仍在 DOM 中、可被平台脚本识别，
              因此不违反"移动端可见"。复用 account-entry snippet，不复制组件。
              2026-10-13：footer 改为与参考图一致的竖排行式（Account / Cart 各一行）。
            {%- endcomment -%}
            <div class="nav-drawer__footer">
              {%- if shop.customer_accounts_enabled -%}
                {% render 'account-entry', class: 'account--in-drawer' %}
              {%- endif -%}
              {%- comment -%}
                cart 入口复用同一 snippet（本期为跳转链接，非按钮——见 T-1.6）；
                show_label 参考图的行式布局：图标 + "Cart" 文字 + 计数徽标。
              {%- endcomment -%}
              {% render 'compare-entry', class: 'compare-entry--in-drawer', show_label: true %}
              {% render 'cart-entry', class: 'cart-entry--in-drawer', show_label: true %}
            </div>
          </div>

          {%- comment -%} ---- 面板 1：每个一级分组的子菜单（二层 + 三层入口） ---- {%- endcomment -%}
          {%- for link in menu.links -%}
            {%- if link.links.size > 0 -%}
              <div
                class="nav-drawer__panel"
                data-nav-panel
                id="{{ section.id }}-nav-panel-{{ forloop.index }}"
                aria-labelledby="{{ section.id }}-nav-panel-{{ forloop.index }}-title"
